# Generated Xcode projects and codegen output (Derived/) are committed: regenerate with
# scripts/post-checkout.sh after changing manifests, assets, strings or GraphQL, and commit the result.

## Build output
build/
DerivedData/

## Tuist
# Package.resolved isn't committed: packages resolve from the version rules in the projects on every machine.
# .package.resolved is Tuist's machine-local package lock.
.package.resolved
**/xcshareddata/swiftpm/
# Xcode recreates each project's inner workspace on open, and builds go through Ugglan.xcworkspace
**/*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/
# Empty marker Tuist rewrites on every generate
Ugglan.xcworkspace/.tuist-generated
# Left behind by `tuist generate --path Projects/<Module>`
Projects/*/*.xcworkspace
# Opt-in local modes; never commit a generation made with these
.local-umbrella
Dependencies/CoreDependencies/RevealServer.xcframework

## Swift packages
LocalModules/*/.build/
LocalModules/*/Package.resolved
LocalModules/*/.swiftpm/configuration/registries.json
LocalModules/*/.swiftpm/xcode/package.xcworkspace/contents.xcworkspacedata
.netrc

## Xcode / macOS local state
xcuserdata/
**/xcshareddata/xcodecloud/
IDEWorkspaceChecks.plist
.DS_Store

## Tooling
# Personal Claude Code settings; shared ones go in .claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.worktrees/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# GitHub Actions accessibility workflow artifacts
accessibility-report.md
swift_files.txt
